Z||000008||lowfierogt||08-05-2001||10:57 AM||||Rob,<P>I know first hand. After we sat down.  I was at TGI Fridays last night and somebody came in and said there a Pontiac Fiero on Fire.  I was like what no way.  Yes its is true.  My car Was on fire.  Some manager guy put the fire out with the extinguisher.  They called the fire truck out but the fire was out.  The fire chief unconnected the battery after the fact.  Im so pissed, the spark plug wire started it on the top of plenum.  Im taking pictures today.  Will the fire truck cost me money?????<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com/87%20fiero_files/Jun0302.JPG"> ||||reg||8
